📖 Football History
Important moments in football history.
1863 — The Football Association
The Football Association was formed in England, helping establish standardized rules for association football.
1930 — First FIFA World Cup
Uruguay hosted the first FIFA World Cup and became the first world champions.
1955 — European Club Competition
European club football entered a major new era with the creation of the European Champion Clubs' Cup.
1992 — Premier League
The English Premier League began in 1992 and became one of the world's most followed football leagues.
